{"id":"d6d83e2561eb1af2","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-cohen-forcing.md","title":"Cohen Forcing Theorems","display":"thm-cohen-forcing — Cohen Forcing Theorems","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-cohen-forcing","aliases":["58-thm-cohen-forcing"],"display":"thm-cohen-forcing — Cohen Forcing Theorems","depends_on":["[[./58-df-cohen.md]]","[[./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md]]","[[58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-cohen-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-cohen-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cohen-forcing — Cohen Forcing Theorems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"./58-df-cohen.md\">58-df-cohen.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d29823616dbc5931\" href=\"?note=d29823616dbc5931\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"04828fe2ae3e423e\" href=\"?note=04828fe2ae3e423e\" title=\"58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md\">58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"50cdef7ad50f7128\" href=\"?note=50cdef7ad50f7128\" title=\"58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes.md\">58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb C,\\leq_{\\mathbb C},\\kappa,\\check\\kappa\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb C,\\leq_{\\mathbb C},\\kappa,\\check\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 为 <code>58-df-set-theory-sentence-codes</code> 固定的成员语言。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ZFC+GCH}}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GCHCode}_{58}\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ZFC+GCH}}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GCHCode}_{58}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Coh}}=\\mathrm{CohenContinuumCode}_{58}(v_0)\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Coh}}=\\mathrm{CohenContinuumCode}_{58}(v_0)\\)</span>。两者均是该文件给出的公式码，不是未指定内容的参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S\\)</span> 使用传递模型载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-transitive-model-cardinals</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohenPosetInModel}_S(P,R,\\kappa,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{CohenPosetInModel}_S(P,R,\\kappa,M)\\)</span> 由下式定义。原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohen}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S\\)</span> 保持环境基数的定义域不变；这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\aleph_2^M\">\\(\\kappa=\\aleph_2^M\\)</span> 只要求是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 内部的基数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CheckName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S\\)</span> 分别保留六元和三元接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\check\\kappa\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\check\\kappa\\rangle\\)</span> 为一元名字赋值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"04828fe2ae3e423e\" href=\"?note=04828fe2ae3e423e\" title=\"58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md\">58-df-transitive-model-cardinals.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohenPosetInModel}_S(P,R,\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\kappa,M)\\land P,R\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P((\\kappa\\times\\omega)\\times2):\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),2)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\subseteq\\kappa\\times\\omega\n\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|&lt;\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land R=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:p\\supseteq q\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CohenPosetInModel}_S(P,R,\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{InitialOrdinalInModel}_S(\\kappa,M)\\land P,R\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P((\\kappa\\times\\omega)\\times2):\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),2)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\subseteq\\kappa\\times\\omega\n\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|&lt;\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land R=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:p\\supseteq q\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ZFC+GCH}})\n\\land\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\kappa,M,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{CohenPosetInModel}_S(\\mathbb C,\\leq_{\\mathbb C},\\kappa,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\kappa,\\kappa,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ZFC+GCH}}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GCHCode}_{58}\\}\n\\land\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Coh}}=\\mathrm{CohenContinuumCode}_{58}(v_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Coh}},\\langle\\check\\kappa\\rangle,\n\\mathbb C,\\leq_{\\mathbb C}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ZFC+GCH}})\n\\land\\mathrm{SecondAlephOfModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\kappa,M,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{CohenPosetInModel}_S(\\mathbb C,\\leq_{\\mathbb C},\\kappa,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\kappa,\\kappa,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ZFC+GCH}}=\\mathrm{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GCHCode}_{58}\\}\n\\land\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Coh}}=\\mathrm{CohenContinuumCode}_{58}(v_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Coh}},\\langle\\check\\kappa\\rangle,\n\\mathbb C,\\leq_{\\mathbb C}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仍然断言向 ZFC+GCH 的可数传递模型添加其内部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_2\">\\(\\aleph_2\\)</span> 个 Cohen 实数，使连续统等于该基数并否定 CH。外部基数谓词与内部基数分开，避免原前提因模型可数而无法满足；被强迫的句子码已逐构造给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-cohen.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-cohen.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"d29823616dbc5931","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]"